<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
  <title>CABT · Online Battle Arena</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <header class="topbar">
      <button id="brand-home" class="brand" type="button" aria-label="대기실로 이동">
        <span class="brand-mark">C</span>
        <span>
          <small id="brand-mode-label">CABT LOCAL ARENA</small>
          <strong>Battle Arena</strong>
        </span>
      </button>
      <nav class="header-actions" aria-label="게임 도구">
        <button id="open-replay-btn" class="button quiet replay-open-button" type="button">리플레이 불러오기</button>
        <button id="new-game-btn" class="button quiet" type="button">새 게임</button>
        <a id="viewer-btn" class="button quiet disabled" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">공식 리플레이</a>
        <a id="official-json-btn" class="button quiet disabled" href="/api/game/official.json">공식 JSON</a>
        <a id="download-btn" class="button quiet disabled" href="/api/game/record.zip">기록 ZIP</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section id="lobby" class="lobby">
        <div class="lobby-intro">
          <div>
            <span class="kicker">PORTABLE BATTLE CLIENT</span>
            <h1>AI 또는 다른 플레이어와<br><em>액션을 보며</em> 대전하세요.</h1>
          </div>
          <p id="lobby-description">
            Kaggle AI와 대전하거나 빠른 매칭·친구 방으로 온라인 1대1 게임을 시작할 수 있습니다.
            모든 선택은 서버가 검증하고 대전 기록은 다시 내려받을 수 있습니다.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="lobby-grid">
          <section class="panel agent-library">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <div>
                <span class="kicker">AI LIBRARY</span>
                <h2>상대 AI 선택</h2>
              </div>
              <span id="agent-count" class="count-pill">0 AI</span>
            </div>
            <div id="agent-grid" class="agent-grid" role="radiogroup" aria-label="상대 AI"></div>

            <label id="agent-dropzone" class="upload-zone local-only-feature">
              <input id="agent-file" type="file" accept=".zip,application/zip">
              <span class="upload-icon">＋</span>
              <span>
                <strong>Kaggle 제출 ZIP 추가</strong>
                <small>main.py · deck.csv · cg 폴더 구조를 자동 인식합니다</small>
              </span>
              <span class="upload-action">ZIP 선택</span>
            </label>
            <div id="agent-trust-note" class="trust-note local-only-feature">신뢰할 수 있는 본인 AI만 추가하세요. 제출 코드는 이 PC에서 실행됩니다.</div>
          </section>

          <section class="panel match-setup">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <div>
                <span class="kicker">MATCH SETUP</span>
                <h2>대전 설정</h2>
              </div>
            </div>
            <form id="start-form">
              <div class="field">
                <span class="field-label">사람 좌석</span>
                <div class="seat-toggle">
                  <label><input type="radio" name="human_seat" value="0" checked><span>Player 0</span></label>
                  <label><input type="radio" name="human_seat" value="1"><span>Player 1</span></label>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <span class="field-label">사람 덱</span>
                <div class="deck-picker">
                  <select id="deck-select" name="deck_ref" aria-label="사람 덱 선택"></select>
                  <button id="open-deck-builder-btn" class="button builder-button" type="button">
                    <span>덱빌더</span><span aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
                  </button>
                </div>
                <small id="deck-selection-note" class="field-note">프리셋 또는 저장한 덱을 선택하세요.</small>
              </div>

              <div class="match-summary">
                <span>선택한 AI</span>
                <strong id="selected-agent-name">AI를 선택하세요</strong>
              </div>

              <div id="result-consent-panel" class="result-consent-panel hidden">
                <label class="participant-name-field">
                  <span>플레이어 이름 <small>선택</small></span>
                  <input id="participant-name" type="text" maxlength="48" autocomplete="nickname" placeholder="Anonymous">
                </label>
                <label class="result-consent-check">
                  <input id="result-consent" type="checkbox" checked>
                  <span>
                    <strong>완료된 대전 결과를 서버에 전송</strong>
                    <small>대전 기록 ZIP과 승패 요약이 운영자에게 전달됩니다.</small>
                  </span>
                </label>
              </div>

              <button id="start-button" class="button primary start-button" type="submit">
                <span>배틀 시작</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </button>
            </form>
            <div class="runtime-status">
              <span id="runtime-dot" class="status-dot"></span>
              <span id="image-status">카드 이미지 확인 중…</span>
              <button id="rescan-images-btn" class="text-button" type="button">다시 검색</button>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <section id="online-match-panel" class="panel online-match-panel hidden">
          <div class="online-match-copy">
            <span class="kicker">PLAYER VS PLAYER</span>
            <h2>온라인 1대1 매칭</h2>
            <p>위에서 선택한 60장 덱과 플레이어 이름을 사용합니다. 모든 행동은 서버에서 턴과 선택지를 검증합니다.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="online-match-actions">
            <button id="quick-match-btn" class="button primary" type="button">
              <span>빠른 매칭</span><span aria-hidden="true">⚡</span>
            </button>
            <button id="create-room-btn" class="button quiet" type="button">친구 방 만들기</button>
            <div class="room-code-join">
              <input id="room-code-input" type="text" maxlength="6" autocomplete="off" placeholder="방 코드 6자리" aria-label="친구 방 코드">
              <button id="join-room-btn" class="button quiet" type="button">코드로 참가</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="online-capacity">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            <span id="online-capacity-text">온라인 서버 확인 중…</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="matchmaking-status" class="panel matchmaking-status hidden" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="matchmaking-pulse"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="matchmaking-copy">
            <span id="matchmaking-kicker" class="kicker">MATCHMAKING</span>
            <h2 id="matchmaking-title">상대 플레이어를 찾는 중</h2>
            <p id="matchmaking-detail">브라우저를 닫지 말고 기다려주세요.</p>
            <button id="copy-room-code-btn" class="room-code-display hidden" type="button"></button>
          </div>
          <button id="cancel-matchmaking-btn" class="button quiet" type="button">대기 취소</button>
        </section>

        <section id="replay-dropzone" class="panel replay-import-panel">
          <div class="replay-import-copy">
            <span class="kicker">REPLAY VIEWER</span>
            <h2>저장된 대전을 다시 봅니다</h2>
            <p>이 프로그램에서 만든 기록 ZIP, 공식 에피소드 JSON, <code>replay_visualize.json</code> 또는 <code>transitions.jsonl</code>을 선택하세요.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="replay-import-actions">
            <button id="replay-browse-btn" class="button primary" type="button">리플레이 파일 선택</button>
            <small>ZIP · JSON · JSONL</small>
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>

      <section id="game" class="game hidden">
        <section class="match-bar panel">
          <div class="match-state">
            <span id="turn-badge" class="turn-badge">TURN 0</span>
            <div>
              <strong id="status-text">게임 준비 중</strong>
              <small id="seat-text"></small>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="playback" aria-label="재생 제어">
            <span id="playback-label" class="playback-label">BATTLE SYNC</span>
            <button id="prev-step-btn" class="icon-button hidden" type="button" title="이전 장면">◀</button>
            <button id="pause-btn" class="icon-button" type="button" title="자동 진행 일시정지">Ⅱ</button>
            <button id="step-btn" class="icon-button" type="button" title="한 단계 진행">▶</button>
            <select id="speed-select" aria-label="AI 액션 표시 속도">
              <option value="1400">0.5×</option>
              <option value="750" selected>1×</option>
              <option value="420">2×</option>
              <option value="240">4×</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="match-meta">
            <span id="agent-chip" class="agent-chip"></span>
            <span id="decision-text">0 actions</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="action-stage" class="action-stage panel idle" aria-live="polite">
          <div id="action-actor" class="action-actor">READY</div>
          <div class="action-copy">
            <strong id="action-title">배틀을 준비합니다</strong>
            <span id="action-detail">AI 행동은 한 단계씩 이곳에 표시됩니다.</span>
          </div>
          <div id="thinking-indicator" class="thinking-indicator hidden">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="replay-controls" class="replay-controls panel hidden" aria-label="리플레이 탐색">
          <div class="replay-file-meta">
            <span class="kicker">LOADED REPLAY</span>
            <strong id="replay-filename">-</strong>
            <small id="replay-format-note"></small>
          </div>
          <div class="replay-scrubber-wrap">
            <input id="replay-scrubber" type="range" min="0" max="0" value="0" step="1" aria-label="리플레이 장면 이동">
            <div class="replay-frame-meta">
              <span id="replay-frame-text">1 / 1</span>
              <span id="replay-turn-text">Turn 0</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <label class="replay-seat-field">
            <span>아래쪽 플레이어</span>
            <select id="replay-view-seat">
              <option value="0">Player 0</option>
              <option value="1">Player 1</option>
            </select>
          </label>
        </section>

        <div class="game-layout">
          <section class="board panel">
            <div id="ai-side" class="player-side opponent-side"></div>
            <div class="center-lane">
              <div class="center-rule"></div>
              <div id="stadium-zone" class="stadium-zone">STADIUM · 비어 있음</div>
              <div id="battle-result" class="battle-result hidden"></div>
            </div>
            <div id="human-side" class="player-side human-side"></div>
          </section>

          <aside class="control-rail">
            <section class="panel decision-panel">
              <div class="section-heading compact">
                <div>
                  <span id="decision-kicker" class="kicker">YOUR DECISION</span>
                  <h2 id="decision-prompt">AI 진행을 기다리는 중</h2>
                </div>
                <span id="selection-counter" class="selection-counter"></span>
              </div>
              <div id="options" class="options"></div>
              <div class="decision-footer">
                <button id="clear-btn" class="button quiet" type="button">선택 해제</button>
                <button id="confirm-btn" class="button primary" type="button">선택 확정</button>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section id="result-submit-panel" class="panel result-submit-panel hidden">
              <div>
                <span class="kicker">BATTLE RESULT</span>
                <strong id="result-submit-title">대전 결과 전송 준비</strong>
                <small id="result-submit-detail">게임이 끝나면 선택한 기록을 서버에 보낼 수 있습니다.</small>
              </div>
              <button id="submit-result-btn" class="button primary" type="button">결과 전송</button>
            </section>

            <section class="panel timeline-panel">
              <div class="section-heading compact">
                <div>
                  <span class="kicker">ACTION TIMELINE</span>
                  <h2>진행 기록</h2>
                </div>
                <button id="timeline-bottom-btn" class="text-button" type="button">최신</button>
              </div>
              <div id="timeline" class="timeline"></div>
            </section>

            <details class="panel log-panel">
              <summary>엔진 로그 <span>펼치기</span></summary>
              <div id="logs" class="logs"></div>
            </details>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>

  <dialog id="deck-builder" class="deck-builder-modal">
    <div class="builder-shell">
      <header class="builder-header">
        <div>
          <span class="kicker">BROWSER DECK WORKSHOP</span>
          <h2>덱빌더</h2>
          <p>카드를 검색해 클릭하거나 오른쪽으로 드래그하세요. 저장한 덱은 이 브라우저에만 보관됩니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="builder-header-actions">
          <button id="builder-new-btn" class="button quiet" type="button">새 덱</button>
          <button id="builder-close-btn" class="modal-close static-close" type="button" aria-label="닫기">×</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="builder-toolbar">
        <label class="builder-name-field">
          <span>덱 이름</span>
          <input id="builder-deck-name" type="text" maxlength="80" placeholder="새 덱">
        </label>
        <label class="builder-load-field">
          <span>불러오기</span>
          <select id="builder-load-select"></select>
        </label>
        <button id="builder-load-btn" class="button quiet" type="button">불러오기</button>
      </div>

      <div class="builder-layout">
        <section id="builder-catalog-pane" class="builder-catalog-pane">
          <div class="builder-searchbar">
            <label>
              <span class="sr-only">카드 검색</span>
              <input id="builder-search" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="카드 이름, ID, 기술 검색">
            </label>
            <select id="builder-type-filter" aria-label="카드 종류">
              <option value="">전체 카드</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="builder-result-heading">
            <span id="builder-result-count">카드 불러오는 중…</span>
            <small>더블클릭하면 상세 보기</small>
          </div>
          <div id="builder-card-grid" class="builder-card-grid"></div>
          <button id="builder-more-btn" class="button quiet builder-more" type="button">더 보기</button>
          <div id="builder-remove-zone" class="builder-remove-zone">
            덱의 카드를 이쪽으로 드래그하면 1장 빠집니다
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="builder-deck-pane">
          <div class="builder-deck-heading">
            <div>
              <span class="kicker">YOUR DECK</span>
              <strong id="builder-count">0 / 60</strong>
            </div>
            <div id="builder-type-stats" class="builder-type-stats"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="deck-progress"><span id="builder-progress"></span></div>
          <div id="builder-deck-list" class="builder-deck-list" aria-label="현재 덱">
            <div class="builder-empty">
              <strong>여기에 카드를 놓으세요</strong>
              <span>왼쪽 카드의 ＋ 버튼을 눌러도 추가됩니다.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="builder-rule-note" class="builder-rule-note">
            대전에는 60장이 필요합니다. 기본 에너지를 제외한 같은 이름의 카드는 최대 4장입니다.
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <footer class="builder-footer">
        <button id="builder-delete-btn" class="button danger-button" type="button" disabled>삭제</button>
        <span class="builder-save-state" id="builder-save-state">이 브라우저에 저장되지 않은 새 덱</span>
        <button id="builder-save-btn" class="button quiet" type="button">저장</button>
        <button id="builder-use-btn" class="button primary" type="button">저장하고 이 덱 사용</button>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  <dialog id="card-modal" class="card-modal">
    <button id="card-modal-close" class="modal-close" type="button" aria-label="닫기">×</button>
    <div id="card-modal-content"></div>
  </dialog>

  <input id="replay-file" class="sr-only" type="file" accept=".zip,.json,.jsonl,application/zip,application/json">
  <div id="toast" class="toast hidden" role="status"></div>
  <div id="lobby-loading" class="lobby-loading hidden">
    <div class="loading-card">
      <div class="spinner"></div>
      <strong id="loading-title">준비 중입니다</strong>
      <span id="loading-detail">잠시만 기다려주세요.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/static/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
